### System Files (Crucial for multi-platform teams) ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

### Environment Variables & Secrets (CRITICAL for security) ###
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.properties.local
*.yml.local

### Maven Wrapper Scripts (Optional, but highly recommended) ###
# Keep maven-wrapper.jar ignored (as you have it), but you can also ignore these
# if you want developers to use their own local Maven installations instead of the project wrapper.
.mvn/
mvnw
mvnw.cmd

### Log Files ###
*.log
logs/

### Crash Dumps ###
*.hprof
